#. Tag: title
#: man-atlantik.6.docbook:37
#, no-c-format
msgid "Description"
msgstr "Descripcion"

#. Tag: para
#: man-atlantik.6.docbook:39
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&atlantik; is a &kde; client for playing Monopoly-like boardgames on the "
"monopd network."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: man-atlantik.6.docbook:42
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Purpose of the atlantik board game is to acquire land in major cities in "
"North America and Europe while being a transatlantic traveller. All game "
"modes are served by monopd, a dedicated game server designed for &atlantik;. "
"One of the game modes plays like the popular real estate board game known as "
"Monopoly."
msgstr ""

